    Bug 2024725 - Protocol handler for net.thunderbird links. r=jtracey
    Registers 'net.thunderbird' protocol with the OS, and sets Thunderbird as the handler when setting
    Thunderbird as the default handler for mail. Thunderbird will then handle URLs of the form
    'net.thunderbird://component/arguments' where 'component' is the name of a component registered in
    the category manager. The URL is passed to the `observe` function on the component.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D289130

